{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful land has been overtaken by the dark wizard Cormac. Countless horrors hunt and kill those who try to escape. It is up to Edward, the captain of the guard, to defeat Cormac and save the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/extras/Juliet.png?t=1748903610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you climb to the top of the Keep, you\u2019ll face zombies, vampires, and other creatures that lurk in the darkness. Use crossbows, shotguns, or even a rocket launcher to dispose of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/extras/Edward.png?t=1748903610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juliet, a sorceress loyal to the king (or maybe just a certain knight in armor) will assist Edward on his journey. She can upgrade your abilities and sell you items or even help you craft weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/extras/EarnRanks.png?t=1748903610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bleakest Keep is a highly replayable game. Test your skills and earn ranks based on your performance. Challenge yourself by aiming for higher ranks and faster times as you climb the Keep and defeat Cormac!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive 4 dark fantasy themed levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use weapons ranging from bows to electric shotguns to even frying pans!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay swarms of dark fantasy creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly replayable! Earn ranks and set new record times!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the world!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3231520?t=1748903610","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3231520?t=1748903610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/3161cf53e903d17a20a7389dc259390e4007d3b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748903610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/3161cf53e903d17a20a7389dc259390e4007d3b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748903610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is blood and gore but it is not realistic."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3718130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peaceful land has been overtaken by the dark wizard Cormac. Countless horrors hunt and kill those who try to escape. It is up to Edward, the captain of the guard, to defeat Cormac and save the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/extras/Juliet.png?t=1748903610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you climb to the top of the Keep, you\u2019ll face zombies, vampires, and other creatures that lurk in the darkness. Use crossbows, shotguns, or even a rocket launcher to dispose of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231520/extras/Edward.png?t=1748903610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juliet, a sorceress loyal to the king (or maybe just a certain knight in armor) will assist Edward on his journey. She can upgrade your abilities and sell you items or even help you craft w